WEBVTT

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.410
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:17.160
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:22.760
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:28.040
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:40.120
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.390
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:51.390
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.400
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.460
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:07.310
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:17.310
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:23.430
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:26.090
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:30.330
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.980
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:35.990
"ASSAULT MOON"

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.420
With this, the lines are complete.

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.310
Rudra.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:01.100
I now remember what I truly am.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.030
A Madou tool of sealing.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.360
I will seal you away with this power!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.600
Let's go!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.800
--Yeah!
--Yes!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.130
All right!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.190
At this rate, we'll take care of that giant thing quick!

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.830
What?!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:41.460
Huh?!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.510
This is bad! Those are souls!

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:51.650
Augh, this is...!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.080
It's swallowing up the souls in the capital!

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:09.560
No way! This'll be endless!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.930
There's got to be a way.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.440
Shit!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:19.070
At this rate, the number of casualties will only increase.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:23.180
First, we have to get the thing away from here!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.350
What?! The roar nullified my spell!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.700
W-We're saved!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.100
As expected of Kaguya-<i>san</i>!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.100
Seimei-<i>sama</i>, have you noticed?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.570
Yeah.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:54.440
Rudra's power. It's different from mere regeneration.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:58.650
Yes, the Rudra I had sealed away

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.250
and the Rudra before us are very different.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.650
It was powerful in the past,

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:08.790
but it is currently far stronger than ever before.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.820
Huh?

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:13.090
Probably... No, I'm sure of it.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:18.570
It absorbed Douman and is using him as a gate to connect to Makai.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.150
That's why new Horrors keep sprouting up to fill in the gaps.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.970
How do we take down a monster like that?!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:28.110
Do not worry. There is definitely a way.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:33.010
Yeah, it just means we need to cut Douman out of Rudra.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:38.590
First, we cut that creepy cracked face of his from the main body.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:44.160
If a new face doesn't sprout up, we'll know it's lost that ability.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:50.470
Then, it'll be back to the same
Rudra Kaguya-<i>san</i> sealed away.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.700
Yes.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:57.340
After that, once the Golden Knight and Silver Knight weaken it,

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:01.310
Seimei-<i>sama</i> just needs to use me and seal it away.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.280
Just use you? You make it sound so easy.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:08.050
Well, you are the only one who can use me.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:12.320
Only you, who has inherited the blood of the Abe family.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.560
Just as Grandfather said.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:23.830
The light shows me the way.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:29.740
Seimei-<i>sama.</i>
Invoke the barrier spell once again!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.210
All right!

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:06.440
We'll finish things here.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:10.280
Raiko. Yasusuke. Just like I've told you.

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:13.610
First, take care of the
Douman coming out of its head.

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:16.020
Cut that away from the main body.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.190
Got it!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.220
Yeah, leave it to us.

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.020
Kintoki!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.420
Yes!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.070
Honorable sirs, to the field of battle!

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:35.240
Raiko, don't fall behind.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.270
Right back at you.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:38.610
But, Yasusuke.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:40.780
I'm so happy to fight side by side with you.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.780
You're such an embarrassing guy.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:45.610
Well, I don't hate that about you.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.950
Let's go!

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.060
S-So strong!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.390
Good! Keep it up!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.100
As expected of you, Yasusuke.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.100
Just hurry up and bring us his head!

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.570
Understood!

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.850
They did it!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.990
Kaguya! Seimei! Now!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.450
Yes.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.000
What?!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.940
Shit! It wasn't enough! There's no end to it!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:46.810
So cutting that Douman away wasn't enough?!

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:49.640
No, you were correct in targeting it.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:55.850
It is just that we must cut away the Douman's darkness within Rudra.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:08:00.490
But if Douman has assimilated with Rudra completely,

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:05.290
it will be near impossible to find that darkness and cut it away.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.330
Nothing to think about!

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.730
In other words, we just need to cut it up, right?

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:12.700
It, along with Douman's darkness!

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.360
Exactly!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.470
What's wrong, Raiko?!

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.750
No!

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:36.860
Cracks in the barrier has allowed time to seep in.

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:39.030
The limit of the armors...

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.900
...is approaching!

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:42.500
At this rate...

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.590
...the lost soul will roar!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:48.670
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.410
There is a limit to donning the armor.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:54.180
At this rate, you'll be consumed by the armor.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.270
Release it for now.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:19.970
Th-This is...

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:22.140
This is Rudra?!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.260
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:26.810
Stop!

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:29.440
Release yourself from the armor now!

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:32.310
Like I could do something like that!

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:36.440
That guy... I have to save Raiko!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.730
Yasusuke!

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.390
Raiko...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.630
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:05.170
Where am I?

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.340
Michinaga.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.110
I see.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.470
Douman, you're...

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:35.940
Hateful light.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:40.610
Raiko! How can you stay so foolishly honest?!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:45.150
You were born of the
Minamoto family and tossed away.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.860
So why do you still believe in the light?!

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.000
Why have you not lost your sparkle?!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.690
The true nature of this world is darkness!

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:53.860
Something like light!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:58.530
Something like salvation is not needed for all eternity!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:00.530
Douman!

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:01.800
That's right.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:06.710
Become the darkness. Become like me. Such is...

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:10.080
A fate fit for one tossed away.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.750
Darkness without light.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:18.050
In darkness. In darkness. Darkness.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:21.060
--Darkness...
--Darkness. Darkness.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:24.390
Raiko! This is bad!
The time of the lost soul!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:50.110
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! You're safe!

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:55.080
Huh?

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:08.140
That's the armor from that time!

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:13.470
Seimei, I'll be the one to release his armor.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:16.310
I am his one and only attendant, after all.

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.050
Why are you stopping me?!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.280
Shut up and watch.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:24.620
It's all right. Raiko was chosen by the armor.

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:38.970
That's right.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:43.270
You have already passed the line once.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.570
I am the Golden Knight.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:53.410
This blade, this power, is for saving all the souls suffering from the darkness and its abuse.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:59.420
The capital, all the people, and the one before me now--

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:03.380
Douman, I will even save your soul as well!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.990
That is what it means to inherit the title of Garo!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.300
Excellent words.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.830
I expect nothing less from my Makai Knight!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:14.770
Seimei!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:19.010
I just need to cut away the Douman's darkness, right?!

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:21.100
That's right, Raiko!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.640
Take this!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.400
It has happened.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.330
Now! Dance!

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:46.800
Blossom!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.700
Flowers of oath!

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:14.490
Go, Raiko!

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:41.090
So you've come to join the darkness without light.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.120
You were fated to join us.

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:46.760
No one has a heart without darkness.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:50.060
Now, reach out and accept it.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.430
--The darkness.
--The darkness.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:57.540
The darkness! The darkness!
The darkness! The darkness!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:02.880
Unfortunately, your darkness cannot snuff out this light.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.650
This light is not only my own.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:10.990
This light is the hope of those who continue to fight the darkness.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:13.820
The blade which protects those without fangs.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.150
There you are!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.760
It is impossible for your light to reach.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:24.730
What?!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:30.470
We, who only yearn for darkness, cannot even see the light!

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:33.070
Yet you wept those tears!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.910
You must have yearned for the light at that moment!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.180
Wrong!

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:38.980
I wept tears of blood

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:43.420
when I truly tossed aside the light and accepted the darkness!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:44.920
Don't you understand?!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:49.660
You still have a will, even after being absorbed by Rudra!

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:52.460
That is the proof of the light inside of you!

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:54.930
What nonsense!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:16:00.870
I've become darkness itself by becoming one with Rudra!

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.460
Douman!

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:10.140
In the name of Garo,
I will cut down your darkness here!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.050
Such a thing as light.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.110
Such a thing as light!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:22.510
Such a thing as light!

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:32.470
Seimei! Kaguya!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.990
Yes!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.370
O power of sealing within me.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:45.640
Grandfather, I'm going to use the spell of the Abe family.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.250
Sadness is not abandon.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.890
Anger is not hatred.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.230
Affection is not fixation.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:16.010
Let's go!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.570
Yeah!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.110
Difference is not hostility.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.750
Gallantry is not arrogance.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:33.390
Life is not illusion.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:35.260
Seimei, what's that?

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:40.070
With twelve pure mantras, we cut away the ties of darkness.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:42.300
This is the essence of the Abe family spells.

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.910
Death is not nothingness.

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:48.740
Talent is not craftiness.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:52.210
Longing is not greed.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:57.450
Resistance is not frantic struggle.

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.790
Adoration is not jealousy.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:35.620
And...

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:40.530
...light is always alongside darkness.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:25.530
Separation is not the end.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:34.820
I will always watch over you all.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.520
Kaguya...

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:40.390
I will witness the path of man.

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:01.570
Let's go home. To our capital.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:15.810
Our capital... But there's not much left of one.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.110
No.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:20.140
The capital will surely return to what it once was.

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.340
You think so?

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:23.340
That's what we should believe.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:28.380
Douman!

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:34.360
Fight me, Raiko!

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.730
Stop, Douman.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.800
You don't have the strength to fight any longer.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:41.230
Darkness is everything to me!

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:44.800
My power is limitless as long as there is darkness!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:48.070
No. If darkness was everything to you,

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:51.340
you would have merged and disappeared within Rudra.

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:55.580
Nonsense! What do you know of me?!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.150
Everyone has light and darkness within them!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.420
So, I'm sure that even you...

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:03.850
Someone who only sees the light dares to say that to me?!

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:05.260
No, even I--

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:07.740
No more words are necessary!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.020
Stop!

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:25.510
Douman, I wanted to...

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:42.890
I will shoulder all of your darkness.

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:44.420
So...

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.960
So warm...

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:55.730
Is this what you call light?

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:13.610
Farewell, Ashiya Douman.

00:22:53.260 --> 00:23:01.190
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:11.170
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:18.320
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.320 --> 00:23:24.320
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:30.670
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:35.810
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:42.440
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:47.650
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>
